1775379895
U: User pointed out Constraint 5 (width ratio) might be too strict due to camera perspective variations.
S: Agreed to drop Constraint 5 (width ratio). Perspective foreshortening from courtside cameras is extreme and nonlinear, making a fixed ratio range unreliable. Constraint 4 (endpoint proximity to sidelines) already covers the same purpose in a perspective-invariant way. Final constraint set: C1 y-band, C2 width≤baseline, C3 angle 10°, C4 endpoint-on-sidelines, C6 select by expected y-position.
